# Store text as LF in the repository, check out native on each platform.
# Matters here because CI runs the suite on both windows-latest and ubuntu-latest.
* text=auto

# The rule above detects binary content on its own, but the raster brand assets
# are stated outright: a line-ending conversion applied to a PNG or an ICO does
# not fail loudly, it silently corrupts the file.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
